sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant K as FIDO authenticator<br/>(local)
  participant E as ESTS
  participant EF as login.microsoft.com
  C->>E: POST /{tenant}/login  (username and password, Figure 5)
  E-->>C: 200 pgid=ConvergedTFA
  Note over E,C: arrUserProofs includes FidoKey<br/>Auth Config also contains arrFidoAllowList, urlFidoLogin,<br/>iAllowedIdentities, urlPost
  Note over C,E: BeginAuth is not used for FidoKey
  C->>EF: POST {urlFidoLogin}
  Note over C,EF: credentialsJson=arrFidoAllowList[0] unchanged, other fields as in Figure<br/>7
  EF-->>C: 200 HTML with a new $Config
  Note over EF,C: sFidoChallenge, sCrossDomainCanary, sessionId
  Note over C,E: Keep initiating page urlPost, sFT, sCtx, canary<br/>Take challenge, cross-domain canary, and sessionId from bootstrap
  C->>K: challenge
  K-->>C: assertion
  C->>E: POST {initiating-page urlPost}: type=23, ps=23, assertion,<br/>lmcCanary, hpgrequestid, ctx, canary, flowToken
  E-->>C: Authorization response, ConvergedTFA, interrupt, or continuation
